\q1 \v 49 \rb Therefore|עַל־\rb*\rb |כֵּ֤ן׀\rb* \rb I will praise You,|אוֹדְךָ֖\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb among the nations;|בַגּוֹיִ֥ם׀\rb*
\q2 \rb I will sing praises|אֲזַמֵּֽרָה׃\rb* \rb to Your name.|וּלְשִׁמְךָ֥\rb*\f + \fr 18:49 \ft Cited in \ref Romans 15:9|ROM 15:9\ref*\f*
