\q1 \v 6 \rb it rises|מֽוֹצָא֗וֹ\rb* \rb at one end|מִקְצֵ֤ה\rb* \rb of the heavens|הַשָּׁמַ֨יִם׀\rb*
\q2 \rb and runs its circuit|וּתְקוּפָת֥וֹ\rb* \rb to|עַל־\rb* \rb the other;|קְצוֹתָ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb nothing|וְאֵ֥ין\rb* \rb is deprived|נִ֝סְתָּ֗ר\rb* \rb of its warmth.|מֵֽחַמָּתוֹ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 7 \rb The Law|תּ֘וֹרַ֤ת\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb is perfect,|תְּ֭מִימָה\rb*
\q2 \rb reviving|מְשִׁ֣יבַת\rb* \rb the soul;|נָ֑פֶשׁ\rb*
\q1 \rb the testimony|עֵד֥וּת\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb is trustworthy,|נֶ֝אֱמָנָ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb making wise|מַחְכִּ֥ימַת\rb* \rb the simple.|פֶּֽתִי׃\rb*
