\q2 \rb bringing joy|מְשַׂמְּחֵי־\rb* \rb to the heart;|לֵ֑ב\rb*
\q1 \rb the commandments|מִצְוַ֥ת\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb are radiant,|בָּ֝רָ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb giving light|מְאִירַ֥ת\rb* \rb to the eyes.|עֵינָֽיִם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb The fear|יִרְאַ֤ת\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֨ה׀\rb* \rb is pure,|טְהוֹרָה֮\rb*
\q2 \rb enduring forever;|עוֹמֶ֪דֶת\rb*\rb |לָ֫עַ֥ד\rb*
\q1 \rb the judgments|מִֽשְׁפְּטֵי־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb are true,|אֱמֶ֑ת\rb*
\q2 \rb being altogether|יַחְדָּֽו׃\rb* \rb righteous.|צָֽדְק֥וּ\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb They are more precious|הַֽנֶּחֱמָדִ֗ים\rb* \rb than gold,|מִ֭זָּהָב\rb*
\q2 \rb than much|רָ֑ב\rb* \rb pure gold;|וּמִפַּ֣ז\rb*
\q1 \rb they are sweeter|וּמְתוּקִ֥ים\rb* \rb than honey,|מִ֝דְּבַ֗שׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb than honey|צוּפִֽים׃\rb* \rb from the comb.|וְנֹ֣פֶת\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb By them indeed|גַּֽם־\rb* \rb Your servant|עַ֭בְדְּךָ\rb* \rb is warned;|נִזְהָ֣ר\rb*
\q2 \rb in|בָּהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb keeping them|בְּ֝שָׁמְרָ֗ם\rb* \rb is great|רָֽב׃\rb* \rb reward.|עֵ֣קֶב\rb*
\b 
