\q2 \rb and cleansed|וְ֝נִקֵּ֗יתִי\rb* \rb of great|רָֽב׃\rb* \rb transgression.|מִפֶּ֥שַֽׁע\rb*
\q1 \v 14 \rb May the words|אִמְרֵי־\rb* \rb of my mouth|פִ֡י\rb*
