\c 21
\s1 After the Battle
\r \ref Proverbs 21:1–31|PRO 21:1-31\ref*)
\d \v 1 \rb For the choirmaster.|לַמְנַצֵּ֗חַ\rb* \rb A Psalm|מִזְמ֥וֹר\rb* \rb of David.|לְדָוִֽד׃\rb*
\q1 \rb O LORD,|יְֽהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb the king|מֶ֑לֶךְ\rb* \rb rejoices|יִשְׂמַח־\rb* \rb in Your strength.|בְּעָזְּךָ֥\rb*
