\q1 \v 9 \rb You will place them|תְּשִׁיתֵ֤מוֹ׀\rb* \rb in a fiery|אֵשׁ֮\rb* \rb furnace|כְּתַנּ֥וּר\rb*
\q2 \rb at the time|לְעֵ֪ת\rb* \rb of Your appearing.|פָּ֫נֶ֥יךָ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb In His wrath|בְּאַפּ֣וֹ\rb* \rb the LORD|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb will engulf them,|יְבַלְּעֵ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and the fire|אֵֽשׁ׃\rb* \rb will consume them.|וְֽתֹאכְלֵ֥ם\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb You will wipe|תְּאַבֵּ֑ד\rb* \rb their descendants|פִּ֭רְיָמוֹ\rb* \rb from the earth,|מֵאֶ֣רֶץ\rb*
