\b 
\q1 \v 11 \rb Though|כִּי־\rb* \rb they intend|נָט֣וּ\rb* \rb You|עָלֶ֣יךָ\rb* \rb harm,|רָעָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb the schemes|מְ֝זִמָּ֗ה\rb* \rb they devise|חָֽשְׁב֥וּ\rb* \rb will not|בַּל־\rb* \rb prevail.|יוּכָֽלוּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 12 \rb For|כִּ֭י\rb* \rb You will put them to flight|תְּשִׁיתֵ֣מוֹ\rb*\rb |שֶׁ֑כֶם\rb*
\q2 \rb when Your bow|בְּ֝מֵֽיתָרֶ֗יךָ\rb* \rb is trained|תְּכוֹנֵ֥ן\rb* \rb upon|עַל־\rb* \rb them.|פְּנֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \rb Be exalted,|ר֣וּמָה\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb in Your strength;|בְּעֻזֶּ֑ךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb we will sing|נָשִׁ֥ירָה\rb* \rb and praise|וּֽ֝נְזַמְּרָה\rb* \rb Your power.|גְּבוּרָתֶֽךָ׃\rb*
\c 22
\s1 The Psalm of the Cross
\r \ref Matthew 27:32–56|MAT 27:32-56\ref*; \ref Mark 15:21–41|MRK 15:21-41\ref*; \ref Luke 23:26–43|LUK 23:26-43\ref*; \ref John 19:16–30|JHN 19:16-30\ref*)
\d \v 1 \rb For the choirmaster.|לַ֭מְנַצֵּחַ\rb* \rb To the tune of|עַל־\rb* \rb “The Doe|אַיֶּ֥לֶת\rb* \rb of the Dawn.”|הַשַּׁ֗חַר\rb* \rb A Psalm|מִזְמ֥וֹר\rb* \rb of David.|לְדָוִֽד׃\rb*
\q1 \rb My God,|אֵלִ֣י\rb* \rb my God,|אֵ֭לִי\rb*
\q2 \rb why|לָמָ֣ה\rb* \rb have You forsaken me?|עֲזַבְתָּ֑נִי\rb*\f + \fr 22:1 \ft Cited in \ref Matthew 27:46|MAT 27:46\ref* and Mark 15:34\f*
\q1 \rb Why are You so far|רָח֥וֹק\rb* \rb from saving me,|מִֽ֝ישׁוּעָתִ֗י\rb*
\q2 \rb so far from my words|דִּבְרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of groaning?|שַׁאֲגָתִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb I cry out|אֶקְרָ֣א\rb* \rb by day,|י֭וֹמָם\rb* \rb O my God,|אֱ‍ֽלֹהַ֗י\rb*
\q2 \rb but You do not answer,|תַעֲנֶ֑ה\rb*\rb |וְלֹ֣א\rb*
\q1 \rb and by night,|וְ֝לַ֗יְלָה\rb*
\q2 \rb but I have no|וְֽלֹא־\rb* \rb rest.|דֽוּמִיָּ֥ה\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 3 \rb Yet You|וְאַתָּ֥ה\rb* \rb are holy,|קָד֑וֹשׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb enthroned|י֝וֹשֵׁ֗ב\rb* \rb on the praises|תְּהִלּ֥וֹת\rb* \rb of Israel.|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb In You|בְּ֭ךָ\rb* \rb our fathers|אֲבֹתֵ֑ינוּ\rb* \rb trusted;|בָּטְח֣וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb they trusted|בָּ֝טְח֗וּ\rb* \rb and You delivered them.|וַֽתְּפַלְּטֵֽמוֹ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb They cried out|זָעֲק֣וּ\rb* \rb to You|אֵלֶ֣יךָ\rb* \rb and were set free;|וְנִמְלָ֑טוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb they trusted|בָטְח֣וּ\rb* \rb in You|בְּךָ֖\rb* \rb and were not|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb disappointed.|בֽוֹשׁוּ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 6 \rb But I|וְאָנֹכִ֣י\rb* \rb am a worm|תוֹלַ֣עַת\rb* \rb and not|וְלֹא־\rb* \rb a man,|אִ֑ישׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb scorned|חֶרְפַּ֥ת\rb* \rb by men|אָ֝דָ֗ם\rb* \rb and despised|וּבְז֥וּי\rb* \rb by the people.|עָֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb who see me|רֹ֭אַי\rb* \rb mock|יַלְעִ֣גוּ\rb* \rb me;|לִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb they sneer|יַפְטִ֥ירוּ\rb*\rb |בְ֝שָׂפָ֗ה\rb* \rb and shake|יָנִ֥יעוּ\rb* \rb their heads:|רֹֽאשׁ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb “He trusts|גֹּ֣ל\rb* \rb in|אֶל־\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֣ה\rb*
\q2 \rb let the LORD deliver him;|יְפַלְּטֵ֑הוּ\rb*
\q1 \rb let the LORD rescue him,|יַ֝צִּילֵ֗הוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb since|כִּ֘י\rb* \rb He delights|חָ֥פֵֽץ\rb* \rb in him.”|בּֽוֹ׃\rb*\f + \fr 22:8 \ft Cited in \ref Matthew 27:43|MAT 27:43\ref*\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb Yet|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb You|אַתָּ֣ה\rb* \rb brought me forth|גֹחִ֣י\rb* \rb from the womb;|מִבָּ֑טֶן\rb*
\q2 \rb You made me secure|מַ֝בְטִיחִ֗י\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb my mother’s|אִמִּֽי׃\rb* \rb breast.|שְׁדֵ֥י\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb From birth|מֵרָ֑חֶם\rb* \rb I was cast|הָשְׁלַ֣כְתִּי\rb* \rb upon You;|עָ֭לֶיךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb from my mother’s|אִ֝מִּ֗י\rb* \rb womb|מִבֶּ֥טֶן\rb* \rb You|אָֽתָּה׃\rb* \rb have been my God.|אֵ֣לִי\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb Be not|אַל־\rb* \rb far|תִּרְחַ֣ק\rb* \rb from me,|מִ֭מֶּנִּי\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּי־\rb* \rb trouble|צָרָ֣ה\rb* \rb is near|קְרוֹבָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and|כִּי־\rb* \rb there is no|אֵ֥ין\rb* \rb one to help.|עוֹזֵֽר׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 12 \rb Many|רַבִּ֑ים\rb* \rb bulls|פָּרִ֣ים\rb* \rb surround me;|סְ֭בָבוּנִי\rb*
\q2 \rb strong|אַבִּירֵ֖י\rb* \rb bulls of Bashan|בָשָׁ֣ן\rb* \rb encircle me.|כִּתְּרֽוּנִי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 13 \rb They open|פָּצ֣וּ\rb* \rb their jaws|פִּיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb against me|עָלַ֣י\rb*
\q2 \rb like lions|אַ֝רְיֵ֗ה\rb* \rb that roar|וְשֹׁאֵֽג׃\rb* \rb and maul.|טֹרֵ֥ף\rb*
\q1 \v 14 \rb I am poured out|נִשְׁפַּכְתִּי֮\rb* \rb like water,|כַּמַּ֥יִם\rb*
\q2 \rb and all|כָּֽל־\rb* \rb my bones|עַצְמ֫וֹתָ֥י\rb* \rb are disjointed.|וְהִתְפָּֽרְד֗וּ\rb*
\q1 \rb My heart|לִ֭בִּי\rb* \rb is|הָיָ֣ה\rb* \rb like wax;|כַּדּוֹנָ֑ג\rb*
\q2 \rb it melts away|נָ֝מֵ֗ס\rb* \rb within|בְּת֣וֹךְ\rb* \rb me.|מֵעָֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 15 \rb My strength|כֹּחִ֗י\rb*\f + \fr 22:15 \ft MT; or \fqa My mouth\ft , a possible reading of the original Hebrew text \f* \rb is dried up|יָ֘בֵ֤שׁ\rb* \rb like a potsherd,|כַּחֶ֨רֶשׂ׀\rb*
\q2 \rb and my tongue|וּ֭לְשׁוֹנִי\rb* \rb sticks|מֻדְבָּ֣ק\rb* \rb to the roof of my mouth.|מַלְקוֹחָ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb You lay me|תִּשְׁפְּתֵֽנִי׃\rb* \rb in the dust|וְֽלַעֲפַר־\rb* \rb of death.|מָ֥וֶת\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 16 \rb For|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb dogs|כְּלָ֫בִ֥ים\rb* \rb surround me;|סְבָב֗וּנִי\rb*
\q2 \rb a band|עֲדַ֣ת\rb* \rb of evil men|מְ֭רֵעִים\rb* \rb encircles me;|הִקִּיפ֑וּנִי\rb*
\q2 \rb they have pierced|כָּ֝אֲרִ֗י\rb* \rb my hands|יָדַ֥י\rb* \rb and feet.|וְרַגְלָֽי׃\rb*\f + \fr 22:16 \ft DSS, LXX, Vulgate, and Syriac; most MT \fqa like a lion at my hands and feet\f*
\q1 \v 17 \rb I can count|אֲסַפֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb my bones;|עַצְמוֹתָ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb they|הֵ֥מָּה\rb* \rb stare|יַ֝בִּ֗יטוּ\rb* \rb and gloat|יִרְאוּ־\rb* \rb over me.|בִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 18 \rb They divide|יְחַלְּק֣וּ\rb* \rb my garments|בְגָדַ֣י\rb* \rb among them|לָהֶ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and cast|יַפִּ֥ילוּ\rb* \rb lots|גוֹרָֽל׃\rb* \rb for|וְעַל־\rb* \rb my clothing.|לְ֝בוּשִׁ֗י\rb*\f + \fr 22:18 \ft Cited in \ref John 19:24|JHN 19:24\ref*; see also Matthew 27:35, Mark 15:24, and Luke 23:34\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 19 \rb But You,|וְאַתָּ֣ה\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb be not|אַל־\rb* \rb far off;|תִּרְחָ֑ק\rb*
\q2 \rb O my Strength,|אֱ֝יָלוּתִ֗י\rb* \rb come quickly|חֽוּשָׁה׃\rb* \rb to help me.|לְעֶזְרָ֥תִי\rb*
\q1 \v 20 \rb Deliver|הַצִּ֣ילָה\rb* \rb my soul|נַפְשִׁ֑י\rb* \rb from the sword,|מֵחֶ֣רֶב\rb*
\q2 \rb my precious life|יְחִידָתִֽי׃\rb* \rb from the power|מִיַּד־\rb* \rb of wild dogs.|כֶּ֝֗לֶב\rb*
\q1 \v 21 \rb Save me|ה֭וֹשִׁיעֵנִי\rb* \rb from the mouth|מִפִּ֣י\rb* \rb of the lion;|אַרְיֵ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb at the horns|וּמִקַּרְנֵ֖י\rb* \rb of the wild oxen|רֵמִ֣ים\rb* \rb You have answered me!|עֲנִיתָֽנִי׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 22 \rb I will proclaim|אֲסַפְּרָ֣ה\rb* \rb Your name|שִׁמְךָ֣\rb* \rb to my brothers;|לְאֶחָ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb I will praise You|אֲהַלְלֶֽךָּ׃\rb* \rb in|בְּת֖וֹךְ\rb* \rb the assembly.|קָהָ֣ל\rb*\f + \fr 22:22 \ft LXX \fqa I will sing Your praises in the assembly\ft ; cited in \ref Hebrews 2:12|HEB 2:12\ref*.\f*
\q1 \v 23 \rb You who fear|יִרְאֵ֤י\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֨ה׀\rb* \rb praise Him!|הַֽלְל֗וּהוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb descendants|זֶ֣רַע\rb* \rb of Jacob,|יַעֲקֹ֣ב\rb* \rb honor Him!|כַּבְּד֑וּהוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb offspring|זֶ֥רַע\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \rb revere Him!|וְג֥וּרוּ\rb*\rb |מִ֝מֶּ֗נּוּ\rb*
\q1 \v 24 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb He has not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb despised|בָזָ֨ה\rb* \rb or detested|שִׁקַּ֡ץ\rb*
\q2 \rb the torment|עֱנ֬וּת\rb* \rb of the afflicted.|עָנִ֗י\rb*
\q1 \rb He has not|וְלֹא־\rb*\rb |וְלֹ֪א\rb* \rb hidden|הִסְתִּ֣יר\rb* \rb His face|פָּנָ֣יו\rb* \rb from him,|מִמֶּ֑נּוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb but has attended|שָׁמֵֽעַ׃\rb* \rb to his|אֵלָ֣יו\rb* \rb cry for help.|וּֽבְשַׁוְּע֖וֹ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 25 \rb My praise|תְֽהִלָּ֫תִ֥י\rb* \rb for You resounds|מֵ֥אִתְּךָ֗\rb* \rb in the great|רָ֑ב\rb* \rb assembly;|בְּקָהָ֥ל\rb*
\q2 \rb I will fulfill|אֲ֝שַׁלֵּ֗ם\rb* \rb my vows|נְדָרַ֥י\rb* \rb before|נֶ֣גֶד\rb* \rb those who fear You.|יְרֵאָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 26 \rb The poor|עֲנָוִ֨ים׀\rb* \rb will eat|יֹאכְל֬וּ\rb* \rb and be satisfied;|וְיִשְׂבָּ֗עוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb those who seek|דֹּ֣רְשָׁ֑יו\rb* \rb the LORD|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb will praise Him.|יְהַֽלְל֣וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb May your hearts|לְבַבְכֶ֣ם\rb* \rb live|יְחִ֖י\rb* \rb forever!|לָעַֽד׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 27 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb the ends|אַפְסֵי־\rb* \rb of the earth|אָ֑רֶץ\rb*
\q2 \rb will remember|יִזְכְּר֤וּ׀\rb* \rb and turn|וְיָשֻׁ֣בוּ\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְ֭הוָה\rb*
\q1 \rb All|כָּֽל־\rb* \rb the families|מִשְׁפְּח֥וֹת\rb* \rb of the nations|גּוֹיִֽם׃\rb*
\q2 \rb will bow down|וְיִֽשְׁתַּחֲו֥וּ\rb* \rb before Him.|לְ֝פָנֶ֗יךָ\rb*
\q1 \v 28 \rb For|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb dominion|הַמְּלוּכָ֑ה\rb* \rb belongs to the LORD|לַ֭יהוָה\rb*
\q2 \rb and He rules|וּ֝מֹשֵׁ֗ל\rb* \rb over the nations.|בַּגּוֹיִֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 29 \rb All|כָּֽל־\rb* \rb the rich|דִּשְׁנֵי־\rb* \rb of the earth|אֶ֗רֶץ\rb* \rb will feast|אָכְל֬וּ\rb* \rb and worship;|וַיִּֽשְׁתַּחֲוּ֨וּ׀\rb*
\q2 \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb who go down|יוֹרְדֵ֣י\rb* \rb to the dust|עָפָ֑ר\rb* \rb will kneel|יִ֭כְרְעוּ\rb* \rb before Him—|לְפָנָ֣יו\rb*
\q2 \rb even those unable|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb to preserve|חִיָּֽה׃\rb* \rb their lives.|וְ֝נַפְשׁ֗וֹ\rb*
\q1 \v 30 \rb Posterity|זֶ֥רַע\rb* \rb will serve Him;|יַֽעַבְדֶ֑נּוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb they will declare|יְסֻפַּ֖ר\rb* \rb the Lord|לַֽאדֹנָ֣י\rb* \rb to a new generation.|לַדּֽוֹר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 31 \rb They will come|יָ֭בֹאוּ\rb* \rb and proclaim|וְיַגִּ֣ידוּ\rb* \rb His righteousness|צִדְקָת֑וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb to a people|לְעַ֥ם\rb* \rb yet unborn—|נ֝וֹלָ֗ד\rb*
\q2 \rb all that|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb He has done.|עָשָֽׂה׃\rb*
\c 23
\s1 The LORD Is My Shepherd
\r \ref Ezekiel 34:11–24|EZK 34:11-24\ref*; \ref John 10:1–21|JHN 10:1-21\ref*)
\d \v 1 \rb A Psalm|מִזְמ֥וֹר\rb* \rb of David.|לְדָוִ֑ד\rb*
\q1 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb is my shepherd;|רֹ֝עִ֗י\rb*\f + \fr 23:1 \ft See \ref Revelation 7:17|REV 7:17\ref*.\f*
\q2 \rb I shall not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb want.|אֶחְסָֽר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb He makes me lie down|יַרְבִּיצֵ֑נִי\rb* \rb in green|דֶּ֭שֶׁא\rb* \rb pastures;|בִּנְא֣וֹת\rb*
\q2 \rb He leads me|יְנַהֲלֵֽנִי׃\rb* \rb beside|עַל־\rb* \rb quiet|מְנֻח֣וֹת\rb* \rb waters.|מֵ֖י\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb He restores|יְשׁוֹבֵ֑ב\rb* \rb my soul;|נַפְשִׁ֥י\rb*
\q2 \rb He guides me|יַֽנְחֵ֥נִי\rb* \rb in the paths|בְמַעְגְּלֵי־\rb* \rb of righteousness|צֶ֝֗דֶק\rb*
\q2 \rb for the sake|לְמַ֣עַן\rb* \rb of His name.|שְׁמֽוֹ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb Even|גַּ֤ם\rb* \rb though|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I walk|אֵלֵ֨ךְ\rb* \rb through the valley|בְּגֵ֪יא\rb* \rb of the shadow of death,|צַלְמָ֡וֶת\rb*\f + \fr 23:4 \ft Or \fqa the valley of deep darkness\f*
\q2 \rb I will fear|אִ֘ירָ֤א\rb* \rb no|לֹא־\rb* \rb evil,|רָ֗ע\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּי־\rb* \rb You|אַתָּ֥ה\rb* \rb are with me;|עִמָּדִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb Your rod|שִׁבְטְךָ֥\rb* \rb and Your staff,|וּ֝מִשְׁעַנְתֶּ֗ךָ\rb* \rb they|הֵ֣מָּה\rb* \rb comfort me.|יְנַֽחֲמֻֽנִי׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \rb You prepare|תַּעֲרֹ֬ךְ\rb* \rb a table|שֻׁלְחָ֗ן\rb* \rb before me|לְפָנַ֨י׀\rb*
\q2 \rb in the presence of|נֶ֥גֶד\rb* \rb my enemies.|צֹרְרָ֑י\rb*
\q1 \rb You anoint|דִּשַּׁ֖נְתָּ\rb* \rb my head|רֹ֝אשִׁ֗י\rb* \rb with oil;|בַשֶּׁ֥מֶן\rb*
\q2 \rb my cup|כּוֹסִ֥י\rb* \rb overflows.|רְוָיָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb Surely|אַ֤ךְ׀\rb* \rb goodness|ט֤וֹב\rb* \rb and mercy|וָחֶ֣סֶד\rb* \rb will follow me|יִ֭רְדְּפוּנִי\rb*
\q2 \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the days|יְמֵ֣י\rb* \rb of my life,|חַיָּ֑י\rb*
\q1 \rb and I will dwell|וְשַׁבְתִּ֥י\rb* \rb in the house|בְּבֵית־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb forever.|לְאֹ֣רֶךְ\rb*\f + \fr 23:6 \ft Literally \fqa for a length of days\f*\rb |יָמִֽים׃\rb*
\c 24
\s1 The Earth Is the LORD’s
\d \v 1 \rb A Psalm|מִ֫זְמ֥וֹר\rb* \rb of David.|לְדָוִ֗ד\rb*
\q1 \rb The earth|הָאָ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb is the LORD’s,|לַֽ֭יהוָה\rb* \rb and the fullness thereof,|וּמְלוֹאָ֑הּ\rb*\f + \fr 24:1 \ft Cited \ref in 1|1\ref* Corinthians 10:26\f*
\q2 \rb the world|תֵּ֝בֵ֗ל\rb* \rb and all who dwell|וְיֹ֣שְׁבֵי\rb* \rb therein.|בָֽהּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb For|כִּי־\rb* \rb He|ה֭וּא\rb* \rb has founded it|יְסָדָ֑הּ\rb* \rb upon|עַל־\rb* \rb the seas|יַמִּ֣ים\rb*
\q2 \rb and established it|יְכוֹנְנֶֽהָ׃\rb* \rb upon|וְעַל־\rb* \rb the waters.|נְ֝הָר֗וֹת\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 3 \rb Who|מִֽי־\rb* \rb may ascend|יַעֲלֶ֥ה\rb* \rb the hill|בְהַר־\rb* \rb of the LORD?|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb Who|וּמִי־\rb* \rb may stand|יָ֝קוּם\rb* \rb in His holy|קָדְשֽׁוֹ׃\rb* \rb place?|בִּמְק֥וֹם\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb He who has clean|נְקִ֥י\rb* \rb hands|כַפַּ֗יִם\rb* \rb and a pure|וּֽבַר־\rb* \rb heart,|לֵ֫בָ֥ב\rb*
\q2 \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֤ר׀\rb* \rb does not|לֹא־\rb* \rb lift up|נָשָׂ֣א\rb* \rb his soul|נַפְשִׁ֑י\rb* \rb to an idol|לַשָּׁ֣וְא\rb*\f + \fr 24:4 \ft Or \fqa to falsehood \ft or \fqa to vanity\f*
\q2 \rb or|וְלֹ֖א\rb* \rb swear|נִשְׁבַּ֣ע\rb* \rb deceitfully.|לְמִרְמָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb He will receive|יִשָּׂ֣א\rb* \rb blessing|בְ֭רָכָה\rb*\rb |מֵאֵ֣ת\rb* \rb from the LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and vindication|וּ֝צְדָקָ֗ה\rb* \rb from the God|מֵאֱלֹהֵ֥י\rb* \rb of his salvation.|יִשְׁעֽוֹ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb Such|זֶ֭ה\rb* \rb is the generation|דּ֣וֹר\rb* \rb of those who seek Him,|דֹּרְשׁוֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb who seek|מְבַקְשֵׁ֨י\rb* \rb Your face,|פָנֶ֖יךָ\rb* \rb O God of Jacob.|יַעֲקֹ֣ב\rb*\f + \fr 24:6 \ft LXX, Syriac, and two Hebrew manuscripts; MT \fqa who seek your face, O Jacob\f*
\qr \rb Selah|סֶֽלָה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb Lift up|שְׂא֤וּ\rb* \rb your heads,|רָֽאשֵׁיכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb O gates!|שְׁעָרִ֨ים׀\rb*
\q2 \rb Be lifted up,|וְֽ֭הִנָּשְׂאוּ\rb* \rb O ancient|עוֹלָ֑ם\rb* \rb doors,|פִּתְחֵ֣י\rb*
\q2 \rb that the King|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Glory|הַכָּבֽוֹד׃\rb* \rb may enter!|וְ֝יָב֗וֹא\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb Who|מִ֥י\rb* \rb is this|זֶה֮\rb* \rb King|מֶ֤לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Glory?|הַכָּ֫ב֥וֹד\rb*
\q2 \rb The LORD|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb strong|עִזּ֣וּז\rb* \rb and mighty,|וְגִבּ֑וֹר\rb*
\q2 \rb the LORD|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb* \rb mighty|גִּבּ֥וֹר\rb* \rb in battle.|מִלְחָמָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb Lift up|שְׂא֤וּ\rb* \rb your heads,|רָֽאשֵׁיכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb O gates!|שְׁעָרִ֨ים׀\rb*
\q2 \rb Be lifted up,|וּ֭שְׂאוּ\rb* \rb O ancient|עוֹלָ֑ם\rb* \rb doors,|פִּתְחֵ֣י\rb*
\q2 \rb that the King|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Glory|הַכָּבֽוֹד׃\rb* \rb may enter!|וְ֝יָבֹא\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb Who|מִ֤י\rb* \rb is He,|ה֣וּא\rb* \rb this|זֶה֮\rb* \rb King|מֶ֤לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Glory?|הַכָּ֫ב֥וֹד\rb*
\q2 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb of Hosts—|צְבָא֑וֹת\rb*
\q2 \rb He|ה֤וּא\rb* \rb is the King|מֶ֖לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Glory.|הַכָּב֣וֹד\rb*
\qr \rb Selah|סֶֽלָה׃\rb*
\c 25
\s1 To You I Lift Up My Soul
\d \v 1 \rb Of David.|לְדָוִ֡ד\rb*\f + \fr 25:1 \ft This psalm is an acrostic poem, each verse beginning with the successive letters of the Hebrew alphabet.\f*
\q1 \rb To You,|אֵלֶ֥יךָ\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb* \rb I lift|אֶשָּֽׂא׃\rb* \rb up my soul;|נַפְשִׁ֥י\rb*
\q2 \v 2 \rb in You,|בְּךָ֣\rb* \rb my God,|אֱ‍ֽלֹהַ֗י\rb* \rb I trust.|בָ֭טַחְתִּי\rb*
\q1 \rb Do not let me|אַל־\rb* \rb be put to shame;|אֵב֑וֹשָׁה\rb*
\q2 \rb do not let|אַל־\rb* \rb my enemies|אֹיְבַ֣י\rb* \rb exult|יַֽעַלְצ֖וּ\rb* \rb over me.|לִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb Surely|גַּ֣ם\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb none|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb who wait for You|קֹ֭וֶיךָ\rb* \rb will be put to shame;|יֵבֹ֑שׁוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb but those who engage in treachery|הַבּוֹגְדִ֥ים\rb* \rb without cause|רֵיקָֽם׃\rb* \rb will be disgraced.|יֵ֝בֹ֗שׁוּ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \rb Show me|הוֹדִיעֵ֑נִי\rb* \rb Your ways,|דְּרָכֶ֣יךָ\rb* \rb O LORD;|יְ֭הוָה\rb*
\q2 \rb teach me|לַמְּדֵֽנִי׃\rb* \rb Your paths.|אֹ֖רְחוֹתֶ֣יךָ\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb Guide me|הַדְרִ֘יכֵ֤נִי\rb* \rb in Your truth|בַאֲמִתֶּ֨ךָ׀\rb* \rb and teach me,|וְֽלַמְּדֵ֗נִי\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb You|אַ֭תָּה\rb* \rb are the God|אֱלֹהֵ֣י\rb* \rb of my salvation;|יִשְׁעִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb day long|הַיּֽוֹם׃\rb* \rb I wait|קִ֝וִּ֗יתִי\rb* \rb for You.|אוֹתְךָ֥\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb Remember,|זְכֹר־\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb Your compassion|רַחֲמֶ֣יךָ\rb* \rb and loving devotion,|וַחֲסָדֶ֑יךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּ֖י\rb* \rb they are|הֵֽמָּה׃\rb* \rb from age to age.|מֵעוֹלָ֣ם\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb Remember|תִּ֫זְכֹּ֥ר\rb* \rb not|אַל־\rb* \rb the sins|חַטֹּ֤אות\rb* \rb of my youth,|נְעוּרַ֨י׀\rb*
\q2 \rb nor my rebellious acts;|וּפְשָׁעַ֗י\rb*
\q1 \rb remember me|זְכָר־\rb* \rb according to|לִי־\rb* \rb Your loving devotion,|כְּחַסְדְּךָ֥\rb*\rb |אַ֑תָּה\rb*
\q2 \rb because of|לְמַ֖עַן\rb* \rb Your goodness,|טוּבְךָ֣\rb* \rb O LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \rb Good|טוֹב־\rb* \rb and upright|וְיָשָׁ֥ר\rb* \rb is the LORD;|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb therefore|עַל־\rb*\rb |כֵּ֤ן\rb* \rb He shows|יוֹרֶ֖ה\rb* \rb sinners|חַטָּאִ֣ים\rb* \rb the way.|בַּדָּֽרֶךְ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb He guides|יַדְרֵ֣ךְ\rb* \rb the humble|עֲ֭נָוִים\rb* \rb in what is right|בַּמִּשְׁפָּ֑ט\rb*
\q2 \rb and teaches|וִֽילַמֵּ֖ד\rb* \rb them|עֲנָוִ֣ים\rb* \rb His way.|דַּרְכּֽוֹ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb the LORD’s|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb ways|אָרְח֣וֹת\rb* \rb are loving and faithful|חֶ֣סֶד\rb*\rb |וֶאֱמֶ֑ת\rb*
\q2 \rb to those who keep|לְנֹצְרֵ֥י\rb* \rb His covenant|בְ֝רִית֗וֹ\rb* \rb and His decrees.|וְעֵדֹתָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb For the sake of|לְמַֽעַן־\rb* \rb Your name,|שִׁמְךָ֥\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb forgive|וְֽסָלַחְתָּ֥\rb* \rb my iniquity,|לַ֝עֲוֺנִ֗י\rb* \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb it|הֽוּא׃\rb* \rb is great.|רַב־\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 12 \rb Who|מִי־\rb*\rb |זֶ֣ה\rb* \rb is the man|הָ֭אִישׁ\rb* \rb who fears|יְרֵ֣א\rb* \rb the LORD?|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb He will instruct him|י֝וֹרֶ֗נּוּ\rb* \rb in the path|בְּדֶ֣רֶךְ\rb* \rb chosen for him.|יִבְחָֽר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 13 \rb His soul|נַ֭פְשׁוֹ\rb* \rb will dwell|תָּלִ֑ין\rb* \rb in prosperity,|בְּט֣וֹב\rb*
\q2 \rb and his descendants|וְ֝זַרְע֗וֹ\rb* \rb will inherit|יִ֣ירַשׁ\rb* \rb the land.|אָֽרֶץ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 14 \rb The LORD|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb confides|ס֣וֹד\rb* \rb in those who fear Him,|לִירֵאָ֑יו\rb*
\q2 \rb and reveals|לְהוֹדִיעָֽם׃\rb* \rb His covenant to them.|וּ֝בְרִית֗וֹ\rb*
\q1 \v 15 \rb My eyes|עֵינַ֣י\rb* \rb are always|תָּ֭מִיד\rb* \rb on|אֶל־\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb He|הֽוּא־\rb* \rb will free|יוֹצִ֖יא\rb* \rb my feet|רַגְלָֽי׃\rb* \rb from the mesh.|מֵרֶ֣שֶׁת\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 16 \rb Turn|פְּנֵה־\rb* \rb to me|אֵלַ֥י\rb* \rb and be gracious,|וְחָנֵּ֑נִי\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I|אָֽנִי׃\rb* \rb am lonely|יָחִ֖יד\rb* \rb and afflicted.|וְעָנִ֣י\rb*
\q1 \v 17 \rb The troubles|צָר֣וֹת\rb* \rb of my heart|לְבָבִ֣י\rb* \rb increase;|הִרְחִ֑יבוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb free me|הוֹצִיאֵֽנִי׃\rb* \rb from my distress.|מִ֝מְּצֽוּקוֹתַ֗י\rb*
\q1 \v 18 \rb Consider|רְאֵ֣ה\rb* \rb my affliction|עָ֭נְיִי\rb* \rb and trouble,|וַעֲמָלִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb and take away|וְ֝שָׂ֗א\rb* \rb all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb my sins.|חַטֹּאותָֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 19 \rb Consider|רְאֵֽה־\rb* \rb my enemies,|אוֹיְבַ֥י\rb* \rb for|כִּי־\rb* \rb they are many,|רָ֑בּוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and they hate me|וְשִׂנְאַ֖ת\rb* \rb with vicious|חָמָ֣ס\rb* \rb hatred.|שְׂנֵאֽוּנִי׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 20 \rb Guard|שָׁמְרָ֣ה\rb* \rb my soul|נַ֭פְשִׁי\rb* \rb and deliver me;|וְהַצִּילֵ֑נִי\rb*
\q2 \rb let me not|אַל־\rb* \rb be put to shame,|אֵ֝ב֗וֹשׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I take refuge|חָסִ֥יתִי\rb* \rb in You.|בָֽךְ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 21 \rb May integrity|תֹּם־\rb* \rb and uprightness|וָיֹ֥שֶׁר\rb* \rb preserve me,|יִצְּר֑וּנִי\rb*
\q2 \rb because|כִּ֝֗י\rb* \rb I wait for You.|קִוִּיתִֽיךָ׃\rb*\f + \fr 25:21 \ft Or \fqa because my hope is in You\ft ; LXX \fqa because I wait for You, O Lord\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 22 \rb Redeem|פְּדֵ֣ה\rb* \rb Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb O God,|אֱ֭לֹהִים\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*
\q2 \rb from all|מִ֝כֹּ֗ל\rb* \rb its distress.|צָֽרוֹתָיו׃\rb*
\c 26
\s1 Vindicate Me, O LORD
\d \v 1 \rb Of David.|לְדָוִ֨ד׀\rb*
\q1 \rb Vindicate me,|שָׁפְטֵ֤נִי\rb* \rb O LORD!|יְהוָ֗ה\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I|אֲ֭נִי\rb* \rb have walked|הָלַ֑כְתִּי\rb* \rb with integrity;|בְּתֻמִּ֣י\rb*
\q2 \rb I have trusted|בָּ֝טַ֗חְתִּי\rb* \rb in the LORD|וּבַיהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb without|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb wavering.|אֶמְעָֽד׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb Test me,|בְּחָנֵ֣נִי\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb and try me;|וְנַסֵּ֑נִי\rb*
\q2 \rb examine|צְרוֹפָה\rb* \rb my heart|כִלְיוֹתַ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 26:2 \ft Hebrew \fqa my kidneys\f* \rb and mind.|וְלִבִּֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb Your loving devotion|חַ֭סְדְּךָ\rb* \rb is before|לְנֶ֣גֶד\rb* \rb my eyes,|עֵינָ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb and I have walked|וְ֝הִתְהַלַּ֗כְתִּי\rb* \rb in Your truth.|בַּאֲמִתֶּֽךָ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \rb I do not|לֹא־\rb* \rb sit|יָ֭שַׁבְתִּי\rb* \rb with|עִם־\rb* \rb deceitful|שָׁ֑וְא\rb* \rb men,|מְתֵי־\rb*
\q2 \rb nor|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb keep company|אָבֽוֹא׃\rb* \rb with|וְעִ֥ם\rb* \rb hypocrites.|נַ֝עֲלָמִ֗ים\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb I hate|שָׂ֭נֵאתִי\rb* \rb the mob|קְהַ֣ל\rb* \rb of evildoers,|מְרֵעִ֑ים\rb*
\q2 \rb and refuse|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb to sit|אֵשֵֽׁב׃\rb* \rb with|וְעִם־\rb* \rb the wicked.|רְ֝שָׁעִ֗ים\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb I wash|אֶרְחַ֣ץ\rb* \rb my hands|כַּפָּ֑י\rb* \rb in innocence|בְּנִקָּי֣וֹן\rb*
\q2 \rb that I may go about|וַאֲסֹבְבָ֖ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Your altar,|מִזְבַּחֲךָ֣\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb to raise|לַ֭שְׁמִעַ\rb* \rb my voice|בְּק֣וֹל\rb* \rb in thanksgiving|תּוֹדָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and declare|וּ֝לְסַפֵּ֗ר\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb Your wonderful works.|נִפְלְאוֹתֶֽיךָ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \rb O LORD,|יְֽהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb I love|אָ֭הַבְתִּי\rb* \rb the house|בֵּיתֶ֑ךָ\rb* \rb where You dwell,|מְע֣וֹן\rb*
\q2 \rb the place|וּ֝מְק֗וֹם\rb* \rb where Your glory|כְּבוֹדֶֽךָ׃\rb* \rb resides.|מִשְׁכַּ֥ן\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb Do not|אַל־\rb* \rb take|תֶּאֱסֹ֣ף\rb* \rb my soul|נַפְשִׁ֑י\rb* \rb away with|עִם־\rb* \rb sinners,|חַטָּאִ֣ים\rb*
\q2 \rb or my life|חַיָּֽי׃\rb* \rb with|וְעִם־\rb* \rb men|אַנְשֵׁ֖י\rb* \rb of bloodshed,|דָמִ֣ים\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb in whose|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb hands|בִּידֵיהֶ֥ם\rb* \rb are wicked schemes,|זִמָּ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb whose right hands|וִֽ֝ימִינָ֗ם\rb* \rb are full|מָ֣לְאָה\rb* \rb of bribes.|שֹּֽׁחַד׃\rb*
\b 
