\q2 \rb a hymn of praise|תְּהִלָּ֪ה\rb* \rb to our God.|לֵֽאלֹ֫הֵ֥ינוּ\rb*
\q1 \rb Many|רַבִּ֣ים\rb* \rb will see|יִרְא֣וּ\rb* \rb and fear|וְיִירָ֑אוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and put their trust|וְ֝יִבְטְח֗וּ\rb* \rb in the LORD.|בַּיהוָֽה׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \rb Blessed|אַ֥שְֽׁרֵי\rb* \rb is the man|הַגֶּ֗בֶר\rb*
\q2 \rb who|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb has made|שָׂ֣ם\rb* \rb the LORD|יְ֭הֹוָה\rb* \rb his trust,|מִבְטַח֑וֹ\rb*
\q1 \rb who has not|וְֽלֹא־\rb* \rb turned|פָנָ֥ה\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the proud,|רְ֝הָבִ֗ים\rb*
\q2 \rb nor to those who lapse|וְשָׂטֵ֥י\rb* \rb into falsehood.|כָזָֽב׃\rb*\f + \fr 40:4 \ft Or \fqa who turn aside to false gods \ft or \fqa who run after lies\f*
\q1 \v 5 \rb Many,|רַבּ֤וֹת\rb* \rb O LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb my God,|אֱלֹהַי֮\rb*
\q2 \rb are the wonders|נִֽפְלְאֹתֶ֥יךָ\rb* \rb You|אַתָּ֤ה׀\rb* \rb have done,|עָשִׂ֨יתָ׀\rb*
\q1 \rb and the plans You have|וּמַחְשְׁבֹתֶ֗יךָ\rb* \rb for us—|אֵ֫לֵ֥ינוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb none|אֵ֤ין׀\rb* \rb can compare|עֲרֹ֬ךְ\rb* \rb to You—|אֵלֶ֗יךָ\rb*
\q1 \rb if I proclaim|אַגִּ֥ידָה\rb* \rb and declare them,|וַאֲדַבֵּ֑רָה\rb*
\q2 \rb they are more than|עָ֝צְמ֗וּ\rb* \rb I can count.|מִסַּפֵּֽר׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 6 \rb Sacrifice|זֶ֤בַח\rb* \rb and offering|וּמִנְחָ֨ה׀\rb* \rb You did not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb desire,|חָפַ֗צְתָּ\rb*
\q2 \rb but my ears|אָ֭זְנַיִם\rb* \rb You have opened.|כָּרִ֣יתָ\rb*\f + \fr 40:6 \ft Hebrew; some LXX manuscripts \fqa but a body You prepared for me\f*
\q1 \rb Burnt offerings|עוֹלָ֥ה\rb* \rb and sin offerings|וַ֝חֲטָאָ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb You did not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb require.|שָׁאָֽלְתָּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb Then|אָ֣ז\rb* \rb I said,|אָ֭מַרְתִּי\rb* \rb “Here I am,|הִנֵּה־\rb* \rb I have come—|בָ֑אתִי\rb*
\q2 \rb it is written|כָּת֥וּב\rb* \rb about me|עָלָֽי׃\rb* \rb in the scroll:|בִּמְגִלַּת־\rb*\rb |סֵ֝֗פֶר\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb I delight|חָפָ֑צְתִּי\rb* \rb to do|לַֽעֲשֽׂוֹת־\rb* \rb Your will,|רְצוֹנְךָ֣\rb* \rb O my God;|אֱלֹהַ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 40:8 \ft Cited in \ref Hebrews 10:5–7|HEB 10:5-7\ref*\f*
\q2 \rb Your law|וְ֝ת֥וֹרָתְךָ֗\rb* \rb is within|בְּת֣וֹךְ\rb* \rb my heart.”|מֵעָֽי׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb I proclaim|בִּשַּׂ֤רְתִּי\rb* \rb righteousness|צֶ֨דֶק׀\rb* \rb in the great|רָ֗ב\rb* \rb assembly;|בְּקָ֘הָ֤ל\rb*
\q2 \rb behold,|הִנֵּ֣ה\rb* \rb I do not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb seal|אֶכְלָ֑א\rb* \rb my lips,|שְׂ֭פָתַי\rb*
\q2 \rb as You,|אַתָּ֥ה\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb* \rb do know.|יָדָֽעְתָּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb I have not|לֹא־\rb* \rb covered up|כִסִּ֨יתִי׀\rb* \rb Your righteousness|צִדְקָתְךָ֬\rb* \rb in|בְּת֬וֹךְ\rb* \rb my heart;|לִבִּ֗י\rb*
\q2 \rb I have declared|אָמָ֑רְתִּי\rb* \rb Your faithfulness|אֱמוּנָתְךָ֣\rb* \rb and salvation;|וּתְשׁוּעָתְךָ֣\rb*
\q1 \rb I have not|לֹא־\rb* \rb concealed|כִחַ֥דְתִּי\rb* \rb Your loving devotion|חַסְדְּךָ֥\rb* \rb and faithfulness|וַ֝אֲמִתְּךָ֗\rb*
\q2 \rb from the great|רָֽב׃\rb* \rb assembly.|לְקָהָ֥ל\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 11 \rb |אַתָּ֤ה\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb do not|לֹא־\rb* \rb withhold|תִכְלָ֣א\rb* \rb Your mercy|רַחֲמֶ֣יךָ\rb* \rb from me;|מִמֶּ֑נִּי\rb*
\q2 \rb Your loving devotion|חַסְדְּךָ֥\rb* \rb and faithfulness|וַ֝אֲמִתְּךָ֗\rb* \rb will always|תָּמִ֥יד\rb* \rb guard me.|יִצְּרֽוּנִי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 12 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb evils|רָע֡וֹת\rb*\rb |עַד־\rb* \rb without|אֵ֬ין\rb* \rb number|מִסְפָּ֗ר\rb* \rb surround me;|אָפְפ֥וּ־\rb*\rb |עָלַ֨י׀\rb*
