\q2 \rb hurry,|חֽוּשָׁה׃\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb* \rb to help me.|לְעֶזְרָ֥תִי\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 14 \rb May those who seek|מְבַקְשֵׁ֥י\rb*\rb |לִסְפּ֫וֹתָ֥הּ\rb* \rb my life|נַפְשִׁ֗י\rb*
\q2 \rb be ashamed|יֵ֘בֹ֤שׁוּ\rb* \rb and confounded;|וְיַחְפְּר֨וּ׀\rb*\rb |יַחַד֮\rb*
