\q2 \rb rejoice|יָ֘שִׂ֤ישׂוּ\rb* \rb and be glad|וְיִשְׂמְח֨וּ׀\rb* \rb in You;|בְּךָ֗\rb*
\q1 \rb may those who love|אֹֽ֝הֲבֵ֗י\rb* \rb Your salvation|תְּשׁוּעָתֶֽךָ׃\rb*
\q2 \rb always|תָ֭מִיד\rb* \rb say,|יֹאמְר֣וּ\rb* \rb “The LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb be magnified!”|יִגְדַּ֣ל\rb*
\b 
