\c 41
\s1 Victory over Betrayal
\r \ref John 13:18–30|JHN 13:18-30\ref*)
\d \v 1 \rb For the choirmaster.|לַמְנַצֵּ֗חַ\rb* \rb A Psalm|מִזְמ֥וֹר\rb* \rb of David.|לְדָוִֽד׃\rb*
\q1 \rb Blessed|אַ֭שְׁרֵי\rb* \rb is the one who cares|מַשְׂכִּ֣יל\rb* \rb for|אֶל־\rb* \rb the poor;|דָּ֑ל\rb*
