\q1 \v 2 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֤ה׀\rb* \rb will protect|יִשְׁמְרֵ֣הוּ\rb* \rb and preserve him;|וִֽ֭יחַיֵּהוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb He will bless him|יֶאְשֹּׁר\rb* \rb in the land|בָּאָ֑רֶץ\rb*
\q1 \rb and refuse|וְאַֽל־\rb* \rb to give him over|תִּ֝תְּנֵ֗הוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb to the will|בְּנֶ֣פֶשׁ\rb* \rb of his foes.|אֹיְבָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb The LORD|יְֽהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb will sustain him|יִ֭סְעָדֶנּוּ\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb his bed|עֶ֣רֶשׂ\rb* \rb of illness|דְּוָ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb and restore him|הָפַ֥כְתָּ\rb* \rb from his bed|מִ֝שְׁכָּב֗וֹ\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb* \rb of sickness.|בְחָלְיֽוֹ׃\rb*
