\q1 \v 6 \rb My visitor|וְאִם־\rb*\rb |בָּ֤א\rb*\rb |לִרְא֨וֹת׀\rb* \rb speaks|יְדַבֵּ֗ר\rb* \rb falsehood;|שָׁ֤וְא\rb*
\q2 \rb he gathers|יִקְבָּץ־\rb* \rb slander|אָ֥וֶן\rb* \rb in his|ל֑וֹ\rb* \rb heart;|לִבּ֗וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb he goes|יֵצֵ֖א\rb* \rb out|לַח֣וּץ\rb* \rb and spreads it abroad.|יְדַבֵּֽר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb who hate|שֹׂנְאָ֑י\rb* \rb me|עָלַ֓י׀\rb* \rb whisper|יִ֭תְלַחֲשׁוּ\rb*\rb |יַ֗חַד\rb* \rb against me;|עָלַ֣י\rb*
\q2 \rb they imagine|יַחְשְׁב֖וּ\rb* \rb the worst|רָעָ֣ה\rb* \rb for me:|לִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb “A vile|בְּ֭לִיַּעַל\rb* \rb disease|דְּֽבַר־\rb* \rb has been poured|יָצ֣וּק\rb* \rb into him;|בּ֑וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb he will never|לֹא־\rb*\rb |יוֹסִ֥יף\rb* \rb get up|לָקֽוּם׃\rb* \rb from where|וַאֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb he lies!”|שָׁ֝כַ֗ב\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb Even|גַּם־\rb* \rb my close friend|אִ֤ישׁ\rb*\rb |שְׁלוֹמִ֨י׀\rb* \rb whom|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb I trusted,|בָּטַ֣חְתִּי\rb*
\q2 \rb the one who shared|אוֹכֵ֣ל\rb* \rb my bread,|לַחְמִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb has lifted up|הִגְדִּ֖יל\rb* \rb his heel|עָקֵֽב׃\rb* \rb against me.|עָלַ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 41:9 \ft Cited in \ref John 13:18|JHN 13:18\ref*\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 10 \rb But You,|וְאַתָּ֤ה\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb be gracious to me|חָנֵּ֥נִי\rb* \rb and raise me up,|וַהֲקִימֵ֑נִי\rb*
\q2 \rb that I may repay|וַֽאֲשַׁלְּמָ֥ה\rb* \rb them.|לָהֶֽם׃\rb*
