\q1 \rb As the deer|כְּאַיָּ֗ל\rb* \rb pants|תַּעֲרֹ֥ג\rb* \rb for|עַל־\rb* \rb streams|אֲפִֽיקֵי־\rb* \rb of water,|מָ֑יִם\rb*
