\q1 \rb leading|אֶדַּדֵּ֗ם\rb* \rb the festive|הָמ֥וֹן\rb* \rb procession|חוֹגֵֽג׃\rb* \rb to|עַד־\rb* \rb the house|בֵּ֥ית\rb* \rb of God|אֱלֹ֫הִ֥ים\rb*
\q2 \rb with shouts|בְּקוֹל־\rb* \rb of joy|רִנָּ֥ה\rb* \rb and praise.|וְתוֹדָ֗ה\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \rb Why|מַה־\rb* \rb are you downcast,|תִּשְׁתּ֬וֹחֲחִ֨י׀\rb* \rb O my soul?|נַפְשִׁי֮\rb*
