\q1 \v 10 \rb Like the crushing|בְּרֶ֤צַח׀\rb* \rb of my bones,|בְּֽעַצְמוֹתַ֗י\rb*
\q2 \rb my enemies|צוֹרְרָ֑י\rb* \rb taunt me,|חֵרְפ֥וּנִי\rb*
\q1 \rb while they say|בְּאָמְרָ֥ם\rb* \rb to me|אֵלַ֥י\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb day long,|הַ֝יּ֗וֹם\rb*
\q2 \rb “Where|אַיֵּ֥ה\rb* \rb is your God?”|אֱלֹהֶֽיךָ׃\rb*
