\s1 Send Out Your Light
\q1 \v 1 \rb Vindicate me,|שָׁפְטֵ֤נִי\rb* \rb O God,|אֱלֹהִ֨ים׀\rb* \rb and plead|וְרִ֘יבָ֤ה\rb* \rb my case|רִיבִ֗י\rb*
