\q1 \rb If|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb your riches|חַ֤יִל׀\rb* \rb increase,|יָנ֑וּב\rb*
\q2 \rb do not|אַל־\rb* \rb set|תָּשִׁ֥יתוּ\rb* \rb your heart upon them.|לֵֽב׃\rb*
