\c 63
\s1 Thirsting for God
\r \ref 2 Samuel 15:30–37|2SA 15:30-37\ref*)
\d \v 1 \rb A Psalm|מִזְמ֥וֹר\rb* \rb of David,|לְדָוִ֑ד\rb* \rb when he was|בִּ֝הְיוֹת֗וֹ\rb* \rb in the Wilderness|בְּמִדְבַּ֥ר\rb* \rb of Judah.|יְהוּדָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \rb O God,|אֱלֹהִ֤ים׀\rb* \rb You are my God.|אֵלִ֥י\rb*
\q2 \rb Earnestly I seek|אֲ‍ֽשַׁחֲ֫רֶ֥ךָּ\rb* \rb You;|אַתָּ֗ה\rb*
\q2 \rb my|לְךָ֨׀\rb* \rb soul|נַפְשִׁ֗י\rb* \rb thirsts for You.|צָמְאָ֬ה\rb*
\q1 \rb My|לְךָ֣\rb* \rb body|בְשָׂרִ֑י\rb* \rb yearns for You|כָּמַ֣הּ\rb*
\q2 \rb in a dry|צִיָּ֖ה\rb* \rb and weary|וְעָיֵ֣ף\rb* \rb land|בְּאֶֽרֶץ־\rb* \rb without|בְּלִי־\rb* \rb water.|מָֽיִם׃\rb*
\b 
