\q1 \v 36 \rb The descendants|וְזֶ֣רַע\rb* \rb of His servants|עֲ֭בָדָיו\rb* \rb will inherit it,|יִנְחָל֑וּהָ\rb*
\q2 \rb and those who love|וְאֹהֲבֵ֥י\rb* \rb His name|שְׁ֝מ֗וֹ\rb* \rb will settle|יִשְׁכְּנוּ־\rb* \rb in it.|בָֽהּ׃\rb*
\c 70
\s1 Hurry, O LORD, to Help Me!
\r \ref Psalm 40:1–17|PSA 40:1-17\ref*; \ref Psalm 141:1–10|PSA 141:1-10\ref*)
\d \v 1 \rb For the choirmaster.|לַ֝מְנַצֵּ֗חַ\rb* \rb Of David.|לְדָוִ֥ד\rb* \rb To bring remembrance.|לְהַזְכִּֽיר׃\rb*
\q1 \rb Make haste, O God,|אֱלֹהִ֥ים\rb* \rb to deliver me!|לְהַצִּילֵ֑נִי\rb*
\q2 \rb Hurry,|חֽוּשָֽׁה׃\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb* \rb to help me!|לְעֶזְרָ֥תִי\rb*
\b 
