\q2 \rb do not|אַֽל־\rb* \rb forsake me|תַּעַזְבֵֽנִי׃\rb* \rb when my strength|כֹּ֝חִ֗י\rb* \rb fails.|כִּכְל֥וֹת\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb my enemies|אוֹיְבַ֣י\rb* \rb speak|אָמְר֣וּ\rb* \rb against me,|לִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb and those who lie in wait|וְשֹׁמְרֵ֥י\rb* \rb for my life|נַ֝פְשִׁ֗י\rb* \rb conspire,|נוֹעֲצ֥וּ\rb*\rb |יַחְדָּֽו׃\rb*
