\q2 \rb and will praise|תְּהִלָּתֶֽךָ׃\rb* \rb You more|וְ֝הוֹסַפְתִּ֗י\rb* \rb and|עַל־\rb* \rb more.|כָּל־\rb*
\q1 \v 15 \rb My mouth|פִּ֤י׀\rb* \rb will declare|יְסַפֵּ֬ר\rb* \rb Your righteousness|צִדְקָתֶ֗ךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb and Your salvation|תְּשׁוּעָתֶ֑ךָ\rb* \rb all day long,|כָּל־\rb*\rb |הַיּ֥וֹם\rb*
\q2 \rb though|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb I cannot|לֹ֖א\rb* \rb know|יָדַ֣עְתִּי\rb* \rb their full measure.|סְפֹרֽוֹת׃\rb*
\q1 \v 16 \rb I will come|אָב֗וֹא\rb* \rb in the strength|בִּ֭גְבֻרוֹת\rb* \rb of the Lord|אֲדֹנָ֣י\rb* \rb GOD;|יְהוִ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb I will proclaim|אַזְכִּ֖יר\rb* \rb Your righteousness—|צִדְקָתְךָ֣\rb*  \rb Yours alone.|לְבַדֶּֽךָ׃\rb*
\b 
