\q2 \rb and to this day|וְעַד־\rb*\rb |הֵ֝֗נָּה\rb* \rb I proclaim|אַגִּ֥יד\rb* \rb Your marvelous deeds.|נִפְלְאוֹתֶֽיךָ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 18 \rb Even|וְגַ֤ם\rb* \rb when|עַד־\rb* \rb I am old|זִקְנָ֨ה׀\rb* \rb and gray,|וְשֵׂיבָה֮\rb*
