\q1 \v 19 \rb Your righteousness|וְצִדְקָתְךָ֥\rb* \rb reaches to|עַד־\rb* \rb the heavens,|מָ֫ר֥וֹם\rb* \rb O God,|אֱלֹהִ֗ים\rb*
\q2 \rb You who|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb have done|עָשִׂ֥יתָ\rb* \rb great things.|גְדֹל֑וֹת\rb*
\q2 \rb Who,|מִ֣י\rb* \rb O God,|אֱ֝לֹהִ֗ים\rb* \rb is like You?|כָמֽוֹךָ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 20 \rb Though|אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb You have shown me|הִרְאִיתַנוּ\rb* \rb many|רַבּ֗וֹת\rb* \rb troubles|צָר֥וֹת\rb* \rb and misfortunes,|וְרָ֫ע֥וֹת\rb*
\q2 \rb You will revive me|תְּחַיֵּינוּ\rb* \rb once again.|תָּשׁ֥וּב\rb*
