\q2 \rb For|עַל־\rb* \rb what|מַה־\rb* \rb futility|שָּׁ֝֗וְא\rb* \rb You have created|בָּרָ֥אתָ\rb* \rb all|כָל־\rb*\rb |בְּנֵי־\rb* \rb men!|אָדָֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 48 \rb What|מִ֤י\rb* \rb man|גֶ֣בֶר\rb* \rb can live|יִֽ֭חְיֶה\rb* \rb and never|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb see|יִרְאֶה־\rb* \rb death?|מָּ֑וֶת\rb*
\q2 \rb Can he deliver|יְמַלֵּ֨ט\rb* \rb his soul|נַפְשׁ֖וֹ\rb* \rb from the power|מִיַּד־\rb* \rb of Sheol?|שְׁא֣וֹל\rb*
\qr \rb Selah|סֶֽלָה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 49 \rb Where,|אַיֵּ֤ה׀\rb* \rb O Lord,|אֲדֹנָ֑י\rb* \rb is Your loving devotion|חֲסָדֶ֖יךָ\rb* \rb of old,|הָרִאשֹׁנִ֥ים׀\rb*
\q2 \rb which You faithfully|בֶּאֱמוּנָתֶֽךָ׃\rb* \rb swore|נִשְׁבַּ֥עְתָּ\rb* \rb to David?|לְ֝דָוִ֗ד\rb*
\q1 \v 50 \rb Remember,|זְכֹ֣ר\rb* \rb O Lord,|אֲ֭דֹנָי\rb* \rb the reproach|חֶרְפַּ֣ת\rb* \rb of Your servants,|עֲבָדֶ֑יךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb which I bear|שְׂאֵתִ֥י\rb* \rb in my heart|בְ֝חֵיקִ֗י\rb* \rb from so|כָּל־\rb* \rb many|רַבִּ֥ים\rb* \rb people—|עַמִּֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 51 \rb how|אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb Your enemies|אוֹיְבֶ֥יךָ׀\rb* \rb have taunted,|חֵרְפ֖וּ\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb have mocked|חֵ֝רְפ֗וּ\rb* \rb every step|עִקְּב֥וֹת\rb* \rb of Your anointed one!|מְשִׁיחֶֽךָ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 52 \rb Blessed be|בָּר֖וּךְ\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb forever!|לְ֝עוֹלָ֗ם\rb*
\b 
