\q2 \rb let us kneel|נִ֝בְרְכָ֗ה\rb* \rb before|לִֽפְנֵי־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb our Maker.|עֹשֵֽׂנוּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb For|כִּ֘י\rb* \rb He|ה֤וּא\rb* \rb is our God,|אֱלֹהֵ֗ינוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and we|וַאֲנַ֤חְנוּ\rb* \rb are the people|עַ֣ם\rb* \rb of His pasture,|מַ֭רְעִיתוֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb the sheep|וְצֹ֣אן\rb* \rb under His care.|יָד֑וֹ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb Today,|הַ֝יּ֗וֹם\rb* \rb if|אִֽם־\rb* \rb you hear|תִשְׁמָֽעוּ׃\rb* \rb His voice,|בְּקֹל֥וֹ\rb*
\q2 \v 8 \rb do not|אַל־\rb* \rb harden|תַּקְשׁ֣וּ\rb* \rb your hearts|לְ֭בַבְכֶם\rb*
\q1 \rb as you did at Meribah,|כִּמְרִיבָ֑ה\rb*\f + \fr 95:8 \ft LXX \fqa as you did in the rebellion\ft ; \fqa Meribah \ft means \fqa quarreling\ft ; see \ref Exodus 17:7|EXO 17:7\ref*; cited in Hebrews 3:15 and Hebrews 4:7.\f*
\q2 \rb in the day|כְּי֥וֹם\rb* \rb at Massah|מַ֝סָּ֗ה\rb* \rb in the wilderness,|בַּמִּדְבָּֽר׃\rb*\f + \fr 95:8 \ft LXX \fqa in the day of testing in the wilderness\ft ; \fqa Massah \ft means \fqa testing\ft ; see \ref Exodus 17:7|EXO 17:7\ref*.\f*
\q1 \v 9 \rb where|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb your fathers|אֲבוֹתֵיכֶ֑ם\rb* \rb tested|נִ֭סּוּנִי\rb* \rb and tried Me,|בְּ֝חָנ֗וּנִי\rb*
\q2 \rb though|גַּם־\rb* \rb they had seen|רָא֥וּ\rb* \rb My work.|פָעֳלִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb For forty|אַרְבָּ֘עִ֤ים\rb* \rb years|שָׁנָ֨ה׀\rb* \rb I was angry|אָ֘ק֤וּט\rb* \rb with that generation,|בְּד֗וֹר\rb*
\q2 \rb and I said,|וָאֹמַ֗ר\rb* \rb “They|הֵ֑ם\rb* \rb are a people|עַ֤ם\rb* \rb whose hearts|לֵבָ֣ב\rb* \rb go astray,|תֹּעֵ֣י\rb*\f + \fr 95:10 \ft LXX \fqa They always go astray in the heart\f*
\q2 \rb and they|וְ֝הֵ֗ם\rb* \rb have not|לֹא־\rb* \rb known|יָדְע֥וּ\rb* \rb My ways.”|דְרָכָֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb So|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb I swore on oath|נִשְׁבַּ֥עְתִּי\rb* \rb in My anger,|בְאַפִּ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb “They shall never|אִם־\rb* \rb enter|יְ֝בֹא֗וּן\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb My rest.”|מְנוּחָתִֽי׃\rb*\f + \fr 95:11 \ft Cited in \ref Hebrews 3:7–11|HEB 3:7-11\ref*, Hebrews 4:3, and Hebrews 4:5\f*
\c 96
\s1 Sing to the LORD, All the Earth
\r \ref 1 Chronicles 16:23–36|1CH 16:23-36\ref*)
\q1 \v 1 \rb Sing|שִׁ֣ירוּ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַ֭יהוָה\rb* \rb a new|חָדָ֑שׁ\rb* \rb song;|שִׁ֣יר\rb*
\q2 \rb sing|שִׁ֥ירוּ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַ֝יהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the earth.|הָאָֽרֶץ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb Sing|שִׁ֣ירוּ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַ֭יהוָה\rb* \rb bless|בָּרֲכ֣וּ\rb* \rb His name;|שְׁמ֑וֹ\rb*
