\q1 \v 3 \rb Declare|סַפְּר֣וּ\rb* \rb His glory|כְּבוֹד֑וֹ\rb* \rb among the nations,|בַגּוֹיִ֣ם\rb*
\q2 \rb His wonders|נִפְלְאוֹתָֽיו׃\rb* \rb among all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb peoples.|הָֽ֝עַמִּ֗ים\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \rb For|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb great is|גָ֘ד֤וֹל\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb and greatly|מְאֹ֑ד\rb* \rb to be praised;|וּמְהֻלָּ֣ל\rb*
\q2 \rb He is to be feared|נוֹרָ֥א\rb*\rb |ה֝֗וּא\rb* \rb above|עַל־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb gods.|אֱלֹהִֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb For|כִּ֤י׀\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the gods|אֱלֹהֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the nations|הָעַמִּ֣ים\rb* \rb are idols,|אֱלִילִ֑ים\rb*
