\q1 \v 6 \rb Splendor|הוֹד־\rb* \rb and majesty|וְהָדָ֥ר\rb* \rb are before Him;|לְפָנָ֑יו\rb*
\q2 \rb strength|עֹ֥ז\rb* \rb and beauty|וְ֝תִפְאֶ֗רֶת\rb* \rb fill His sanctuary.|בְּמִקְדָּשֽׁוֹ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 7 \rb Ascribe|הָב֣וּ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|לַ֭יהוָה\rb* \rb O families|מִשְׁפְּח֣וֹת\rb* \rb of the nations,|עַמִּ֑ים\rb*
