\q1 \v 8 \rb Ascribe|הָב֣וּ\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַ֭יהוָה\rb* \rb the glory|כְּב֣וֹד\rb* \rb due His name;|שְׁמ֑וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb bring|שְׂאֽוּ־\rb* \rb an offering|מִ֝נְחָ֗ה\rb* \rb and enter|וּבֹ֥אוּ\rb* \rb His courts.|לְחַצְרוֹתָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb Worship|הִשְׁתַּחֲו֣וּ\rb* \rb the LORD|לַ֭יהוָה\rb* \rb in the splendor|בְּהַדְרַת־\rb* \rb of His holiness;|קֹ֑דֶשׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb tremble|חִ֥ילוּ\rb* \rb before Him,|מִ֝פָּנָ֗יו\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the earth.|הָאָֽרֶץ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 10 \rb Declare|אִמְר֤וּ\rb* \rb among the nations:|בַגּוֹיִ֨ם׀\rb* \rb “The LORD|יְה֘וָ֤ה\rb* \rb reigns!”|מָלָ֗ךְ\rb*\rb |אַף־\rb*
\q2 \rb The world|תֵּ֭בֵל\rb* \rb is firmly established;|תִּכּ֣וֹן\rb* \rb it cannot|בַּל־\rb* \rb be moved;|תִּמּ֑וֹט\rb*
\q2 \rb He will judge|יָדִ֥ין\rb* \rb the peoples|עַ֝מִּ֗ים\rb* \rb with equity.|בְּמֵישָׁרִֽים׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 11 \rb Let the heavens|הַ֭שָּׁמַיִם\rb* \rb be glad|יִשְׂמְח֣וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and the earth|הָאָ֑רֶץ\rb* \rb rejoice;|וְתָגֵ֣ל\rb*
