\q2 \rb will sing for joy|יְ֝רַנְּנ֗וּ\rb* \v 13 \rb before|לִפְנֵ֤י\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֨ה׀\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּ֬י\rb* \rb He is coming—|בָ֗א\rb*
\q2 \rb |כִּ֥י\rb* \rb He is coming|בָא֮\rb* \rb to judge|לִשְׁפֹּ֪ט\rb* \rb the earth.|הָ֫אָ֥רֶץ\rb*
\q1 \rb He will judge|יִשְׁפֹּֽט־\rb* \rb the world|תֵּבֵ֥ל\rb* \rb in righteousness|בְּצֶ֑דֶק\rb*
\q2 \rb and the peoples|וְ֝עַמִּ֗ים\rb* \rb in His faithfulness.|בֶּאֱמוּנָתֽוֹ׃\rb*
\c 97
\s1 Let the Earth Rejoice
\q1 \v 1 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb reigns,|מָ֭לָךְ\rb* \rb let the earth|הָאָ֑רֶץ\rb* \rb rejoice;|תָּגֵ֣ל\rb*
\q2 \rb let the distant|רַבִּֽים׃\rb* \rb shores|אִיִּ֥ים\rb* \rb be glad.|יִ֝שְׂמְח֗וּ\rb*
\b 
