\q1 \v 3 \rb Fire|אֵ֭שׁ\rb* \rb goes|תֵּלֵ֑ךְ\rb* \rb before Him|לְפָנָ֣יו\rb*
\q2 \rb and consumes|וּתְלַהֵ֖ט\rb* \rb His foes|צָרָֽיו׃\rb* \rb on every side.|סָבִ֣יב\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb His lightning|בְרָקָ֣יו\rb* \rb illuminates|הֵאִ֣ירוּ\rb* \rb the world;|תֵּבֵ֑ל\rb*
