\q1 \v 5 \rb The mountains|הָרִ֗ים\rb* \rb melt|נָ֭מַסּוּ\rb* \rb like wax|כַּדּוֹנַ֗ג\rb*
\q2 \rb at the presence|מִלִּפְנֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb before|מִ֝לִּפְנֵ֗י\rb* \rb the Lord|אֲד֣וֹן\rb* \rb of all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the earth.|הָאָֽרֶץ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb The heavens|הַשָּׁמַ֣יִם\rb* \rb proclaim|הִגִּ֣ידוּ\rb* \rb His righteousness;|צִדְק֑וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb all|כָל־\rb* \rb the peoples|הָעַמִּ֣ים\rb* \rb see|וְרָא֖וּ\rb* \rb His glory.|כְּבוֹדֽוֹ׃\rb*
\b 
