\q2 \rb and revealed|גִּלָּ֥ה\rb* \rb His righteousness|צִדְקָתֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb to|לְעֵינֵ֥י\rb* \rb the nations.|הַ֝גּוֹיִ֗ם\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb He has remembered|זָ֘כַ֤ר\rb* \rb His love|חַסְדּ֨וֹ׀\rb* \rb and faithfulness|וֶֽאֱֽמוּנָתוֹ֮\rb*
\q2 \rb to the house|לְבֵ֪ית\rb* \rb of Israel;|יִשְׂרָ֫אֵ֥ל\rb*
\q1 \rb all|כָל־\rb* \rb the ends|אַפְסֵי־\rb* \rb of the earth|אָ֑רֶץ\rb*\rb |אֵ֝֗ת\rb*
\q2 \rb have seen|רָא֥וּ\rb* \rb the salvation|יְשׁוּעַ֥ת\rb* \rb of our God.|אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ׃\rb*
\b 
