\q2 \rb in melodious|זִמְרָֽה׃\rb* \rb song|וְק֣וֹל\rb* \rb with the harp.|בְּ֝כִנּ֗וֹר\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb With trumpets|בַּ֭חֲצֹ֣צְרוֹת\rb* \rb and the blast|וְק֣וֹל\rb* \rb of the ram’s horn|שׁוֹפָ֑ר\rb*
\q2 \rb shout for joy|הָ֝רִ֗יעוּ\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֤י׀\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָֽה׃\rb* \rb the King.|הַמֶּ֬לֶךְ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 7 \rb Let the sea|הַ֭יָּם\rb* \rb resound,|יִרְעַ֣ם\rb* \rb and all that fills it,|וּמְלֹא֑וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb the world,|תֵּ֝בֵ֗ל\rb* \rb and all who dwell|וְיֹ֣שְׁבֵי\rb* \rb in it.|בָֽהּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb Let the rivers|נְהָר֥וֹת\rb* \rb clap|יִמְחֲאוּ־\rb* \rb their hands,|כָ֑ף\rb*
\q2 \rb let the mountains|הָרִ֥ים\rb* \rb sing together|יַ֝֗חַד\rb* \rb for joy|יְרַנֵּֽנוּ׃\rb*
