\q1 \v 19 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb He looked down|הִ֭שְׁקִיף\rb* \rb from the heights|מִמְּר֣וֹם\rb* \rb of His sanctuary;|קָדְשׁ֑וֹ\rb*
