\q2 \rb and praise Him|וּ֝תְהִלָּת֗וֹ\rb* \rb in Jerusalem,|בִּירוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 22 \rb when peoples|עַמִּ֣ים\rb*\rb |יַחְדָּ֑ו\rb* \rb and kingdoms|וּ֝מַמְלָכ֗וֹת\rb* \rb assemble|בְּהִקָּבֵ֣ץ\rb*
