\q1 \v 3 \rb He who forgives|הַסֹּלֵ֥חַ\rb* \rb all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb your iniquities|עֲוֺנֵ֑כִי\rb*
\q2 \rb and heals|הָ֝רֹפֵ֗א\rb* \rb all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb your diseases,|תַּחֲלֻאָֽיְכִי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb who redeems|הַגּוֹאֵ֣ל\rb* \rb your life|חַיָּ֑יְכִי\rb* \rb from the Pit|מִשַּׁ֣חַת\rb*
\q2 \rb and crowns|הַֽ֝מְעַטְּרֵ֗כִי\rb* \rb you with loving devotion|חֶ֣סֶד\rb* \rb and compassion,|וְרַחֲמִֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb who satisfies you|הַמַּשְׂבִּ֣יַע\rb* \rb with good|בַּטּ֣וֹב\rb* \rb things,|עֶדְיֵ֑ךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb so that your youth|נְעוּרָֽיְכִי׃\rb* \rb is renewed|תִּתְחַדֵּ֖שׁ\rb* \rb like the eagle’s.|כַּנֶּ֣שֶׁר\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 6 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb executes|עֹשֵׂ֣ה\rb* \rb righteousness|צְדָק֣וֹת\rb*
