\q1 \v 7 \rb He made known|יוֹדִ֣יעַ\rb* \rb His ways|דְּרָכָ֣יו\rb* \rb to Moses,|לְמֹשֶׁ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb His deeds|עֲלִילֽוֹתָיו׃\rb* \rb to the people|לִבְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Israel.|יִ֝שְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb is compassionate|רַח֣וּם\rb* \rb and gracious,|וְחַנּ֣וּן\rb*
