\q1 \v 10 \rb He has not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb dealt|עָ֣שָׂה\rb* \rb with us|וְלֹ֥א\rb* \rb according to|לָ֑נוּ\rb* \rb our sins|כַ֭חֲטָאֵינוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb or repaid us|גָּמַ֥ל\rb* \rb according to|עָלֵֽינוּ׃\rb* \rb our iniquities.|כַ֝עֲוֺנֹתֵ֗ינוּ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 11 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb as high|כִגְבֹ֣הַּ\rb* \rb as the heavens|שָׁ֭מַיִם\rb* \rb are above|עַל־\rb* \rb the earth,|הָאָ֑רֶץ\rb*
