\q2 \rb the loving devotion|וְחֶ֤סֶד\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֨ה׀\rb*
\q2 \rb extends to|עַל־\rb* \rb those who fear Him,|יְרֵאָ֑יו\rb*
