\q1 \v 19 \rb The LORD|יְֽהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb has established|הֵכִ֣ין\rb* \rb His throne|כִּסְא֑וֹ\rb* \rb in heaven,|בַּ֭שָּׁמַיִם\rb*
