\q1 \v 22 \rb Bless|בָּרֲכ֤וּ\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֨ה׀\rb* \rb all|כָּֽל־\rb* \rb His works|מַעֲשָׂ֗יו\rb*
\q2 \rb in all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb places|מְקֹמ֥וֹת\rb* \rb of His dominion.|מֶמְשַׁלְתּ֑וֹ\rb*
