\q1 \rb Bless|בָּרֲכִ֥י\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָֽה׃\rb* \rb O my soul!|נַ֝פְשִׁ֗י\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*
\c 104
\s1 How Many Are Your Works, O LORD!
\q1 \v 1 \rb Bless|בָּרֲכִ֥י\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְה֫וָ֥ה\rb* \rb O my soul!|נַפְשִׁ֗י\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*
\b 
