\q2 \rb flames|לֹהֵֽט׃\rb* \rb of fire|אֵ֣שׁ\rb* \rb His servants.|מְ֝שָׁרְתָ֗יו\rb*\f + \fr 104:4 \ft LXX \fqa He makes His angels winds, His servants flames of fire.\ft Cited in \ref Hebrews 1:7|HEB 1:7\ref*\f*
