\q2 \rb the waters|מָֽיִם׃\rb* \rb stood|יַֽעַמְדוּ־\rb* \rb above|עַל־\rb* \rb the mountains.|הָ֝רִ֗ים\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb At|מִן־\rb* \rb Your rebuke|גַּעֲרָ֣תְךָ֣\rb* \rb the waters fled;|יְנוּס֑וּן\rb*
\q2 \rb at|מִן־\rb* \rb the sound|ק֥וֹל\rb* \rb of Your thunder|רַֽ֝עַמְךָ֗\rb* \rb they hurried away—|יֵחָפֵזֽוּן׃\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb the mountains|הָ֭רִים\rb* \rb rose|יַעֲל֣וּ\rb* \rb and the valleys|בְקָע֑וֹת\rb* \rb sank|יֵרְד֣וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the place|מְ֝ק֗וֹם\rb*\rb |זֶ֤ה׀\rb* \rb You assigned|יָסַ֬דְתָּ\rb* \rb for them—|לָהֶֽם׃\rb*
