\q1 \v 12 \rb May there be|יְהִ֥י\rb* \rb no one|וְֽאַל־\rb* \rb to extend|מֹשֵׁ֣ךְ\rb* \rb kindness|חָ֑סֶד\rb* \rb to him,|ל֭וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb and|יְהִי־\rb* \rb no one|אַל־\rb* \rb to favor|ח֝וֹנֵ֗ן\rb* \rb his fatherless children.|לִיתוֹמָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 13 \rb May his descendants|אַחֲרִית֥וֹ\rb* \rb be|יְהִֽי־\rb* \rb cut off;|לְהַכְרִ֑ית\rb*
