\c 119
\s1 Your Word Is a Lamp to My Feet
\qa א
\qa ALEPH
\q1 \v 1 \rb Blessed|אַשְׁרֵ֥י\rb*\f + \fr 119:1 \ft This psalm is an acrostic poem of twenty-two stanzas, following the letters of the Hebrew alphabet; within a stanza, each verse begins with the same Hebrew letter.\f* \rb are those whose way|דָ֑רֶךְ\rb* \rb is blameless,|תְמִֽימֵי־\rb*
