\q2 \rb my uplifted|מַֽשְׂאַ֥ת\rb* \rb hands,|כַּ֝פַּ֗י\rb* \rb like the evening|עָֽרֶב׃\rb* \rb offering.|מִנְחַת־\rb*
\b 
