\q2 \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I am brought|דַלּ֪וֹתִ֫י\rb* \rb quite low.|מְאֹ֥ד\rb*
\q1 \rb Rescue me|הַצִּילֵ֥נִי\rb* \rb from|מִמֶּֽנִּי׃\rb* \rb my pursuers,|מֵרֹדְפַ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּ֖י\rb* \rb they are too strong for me.|אָמְצ֣וּ\rb*
