\q2 \rb that I may praise|לְהוֹד֪וֹת\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Your name.|שְׁ֫מֶ֥ךָ\rb*
\q1 \rb The righteous|צַדִּיקִ֑ים\rb* \rb will gather around me|יַכְתִּ֣רוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb because|כִּ֖י\rb* \rb of Your goodness|תִגְמֹ֣ל\rb* \rb to me.|עָלָֽי׃\rb*
\c 143
