\q2 \rb crushing|דִּכָּ֣א\rb* \rb my life|חַיָּתִ֑י\rb* \rb to the ground,|לָ֭אָרֶץ\rb*
\q1 \rb making me dwell|הוֹשִׁיבַ֥נִי\rb* \rb in darkness|בְ֝מַחֲשַׁכִּ֗ים\rb*
\q2 \rb like those long since|עוֹלָֽם׃\rb* \rb dead.|כְּמֵתֵ֥י\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb My spirit|רוּחִ֑י\rb* \rb grows faint|וַתִּתְעַטֵּ֣ף\rb* \rb within me;|עָלַ֣י\rb*
\q2 \rb my heart|לִבִּֽי׃\rb* \rb is dismayed|יִשְׁתּוֹמֵ֥ם\rb* \rb inside me.|בְּ֝תוֹכִ֗י\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \rb I remember|זָ֘כַ֤רְתִּי\rb* \rb the days|יָמִ֨ים׀\rb* \rb of old;|מִקֶּ֗דֶם\rb*
\q2 \rb I meditate|הָגִ֥יתִי\rb* \rb on all|בְכָל־\rb* \rb Your works;|פָּעֳלֶ֑ךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb I consider|אֲשׂוֹחֵֽחַ׃\rb* \rb the work|בְּֽמַעֲשֵׂ֖ה\rb* \rb of Your hands.|יָדֶ֣יךָ\rb*
