\q2 \rb my soul|נַפְשִׁ֓י׀\rb* \rb thirsts|עֲיֵפָ֖ה\rb* \rb for You|לְךָ֣\rb* \rb like a parched land.|כְּאֶֽרֶץ־\rb*
\qr \rb Selah|סֶֽלָה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb Answer me|עֲנֵ֨נִי׀\rb* \rb quickly,|מַ֘הֵ֤ר\rb* \rb O LORD;|יְהוָה֮\rb*
