\q2 \rb whose hope|שִׂ֝בְר֗וֹ\rb* \rb is in|עַל־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb his God,|אֱלֹהָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb the Maker|עֹשֶׂ֤ה׀\rb* \rb of heaven|שָׁ֘מַ֤יִם\rb* \rb and earth,|וָאָ֗רֶץ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*
\q2 \rb the sea,|הַיָּ֥ם\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb and everything|כָּל־\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb in them.|בָּ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb He remains|הַשֹּׁמֵ֖ר\rb* \rb faithful|אֱמֶ֣ת\rb* \rb forever.|לְעוֹלָֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb He executes|עֹשֶׂ֤ה\rb* \rb justice|מִשְׁפָּ֨ט׀\rb* \rb for the oppressed|לָעֲשׁוּקִ֗ים\rb*
\q2 \rb and gives|נֹתֵ֣ן\rb* \rb food|לֶ֭חֶם\rb* \rb to the hungry.|לָרְעֵבִ֑ים\rb*
