\q2 \v 8 \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֤ה׀\rb* \rb opens the eyes of|פֹּ֘קֵ֤חַ\rb* \rb the blind,|עִוְרִ֗ים\rb*
\q1 \rb the LORD|יְ֭הוָה\rb* \rb lifts|זֹקֵ֣ף\rb* \rb those who are weighed down,|כְּפוּפִ֑ים\rb*
\q2 \rb the LORD|יְ֝הוָ֗ה\rb* \rb loves|אֹהֵ֥ב\rb* \rb the righteous.|צַדִּיקִֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֤ה׀\rb* \rb protects|שֹׁ֘מֵ֤ר\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb foreigners;|גֵּרִ֗ים\rb*
\q2 \rb He sustains|יְעוֹדֵ֑ד\rb* \rb the fatherless|יָת֣וֹם\rb* \rb and the widow,|וְאַלְמָנָ֣ה\rb*
\q2 \rb but the ways|וְדֶ֖רֶךְ\rb* \rb of the wicked|רְשָׁעִ֣ים\rb* \rb He frustrates.|יְעַוֵּֽת׃\rb*
