\q2 \rb He gathers|יְכַנֵּֽס׃\rb* \rb the exiles|נִדְחֵ֖י\rb* \rb of Israel.|יִשְׂרָאֵ֣ל\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb He heals|הָ֭רֹפֵא\rb* \rb the brokenhearted|לִשְׁב֣וּרֵי\rb*\rb |לֵ֑ב\rb*
