\q1 \v 4 \rb He determines|מוֹנֶ֣ה\rb* \rb the number|מִ֭סְפָּר\rb* \rb of the stars;|לַכּוֹכָבִ֑ים\rb*
\q2 \rb He calls them|יִקְרָֽא׃\rb* \rb each|לְ֝כֻלָּ֗ם\rb* \rb by name.|שֵׁמ֥וֹת\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb Great|גָּד֣וֹל\rb* \rb is our Lord,|אֲדוֹנֵ֣ינוּ\rb* \rb and mighty|וְרַב־\rb* \rb in power;|כֹּ֑חַ\rb*
\q2 \rb His understanding|לִ֝תְבוּנָת֗וֹ\rb* \rb has no|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb limit.|מִסְפָּֽר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb sustains|מְעוֹדֵ֣ד\rb* \rb the humble,|עֲנָוִ֣ים\rb*
