\q2 \rb make music|זַמְּר֖וּ\rb* \rb on the harp|בְכִנּֽוֹר׃\rb* \rb to our God,|לֵאלֹהֵ֣ינוּ\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb who covers|הַֽמְכַסֶּ֬ה\rb* \rb the sky|שָׁמַ֨יִם׀\rb* \rb with clouds,|בְּעָבִ֗ים\rb*
