\q2 \rb and for the young|לִבְנֵ֥י\rb* \rb ravens|עֹ֝רֵ֗ב\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb when they call.|יִקְרָֽאוּ׃\rb*
\b 
