\q2 \rb His word|דְּבָרֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb runs|יָר֥וּץ\rb* \rb swiftly.|מְ֝הֵרָ֗ה\rb*
\q1 \v 16 \rb He spreads|הַנֹּתֵ֣ן\rb* \rb the snow|שֶׁ֣לֶג\rb* \rb like wool;|כַּצָּ֑מֶר\rb*
\q2 \rb He scatters|יְפַזֵּֽר׃\rb* \rb the frost|כְּ֝פ֗וֹר\rb* \rb like ashes;|כָּאֵ֥פֶר\rb*
\q1 \v 17 \rb He casts forth|מַשְׁלִ֣יךְ\rb* \rb His hail|קַֽרְח֣וֹ\rb* \rb like pebbles.|כְפִתִּ֑ים\rb*\f + \fr 147:17 \ft Or \fqa like crumbs \ft or \fqa like morsels\f*
\q2 \rb Who|מִ֣י\rb* \rb can withstand|לִפְנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |יַעֲמֹֽד׃\rb* \rb His icy blast?|קָ֝רָת֗וֹ\rb*
\q1 \v 18 \rb He sends forth|יִשְׁלַ֣ח\rb* \rb His word|דְּבָר֣וֹ\rb* \rb and melts them;|וְיַמְסֵ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb He unleashes|יַשֵּׁ֥ב\rb* \rb His winds,|ר֝וּח֗וֹ\rb* \rb and the waters|מָֽיִם׃\rb* \rb flow.|יִזְּלוּ־\rb*
\b 
