\q2 \rb His statutes|חֻקָּ֥יו\rb* \rb and judgments|וּ֝מִשְׁפָּטָ֗יו\rb* \rb to Israel.|לְיִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb*
\q1 \v 20 \rb He has done|עָ֤שָׂה\rb* \rb this|כֵ֨ן׀\rb* \rb for no other|לְכָל־\rb*\rb |לֹ֘א\rb* \rb nation;|גּ֗וֹי\rb*
\q2 \rb they do not|בַּל־\rb* \rb know|יְדָע֗וּם\rb* \rb His judgments.|וּמִשְׁפָּטִ֥ים\rb*\f + \fr 147:20 \ft MT; DSS and LXX \fqa He has not made known to them His judgments\f*
