\q1 \v 1 \rb Hallelujah!|הַ֥לְלוּ\rb*\f + \fr 149:1 \ft Or \fqa Hallelu YAH\ft , meaning \fqa Praise the LORD\ft ; also in verse 9\f*\rb |יָ֨הּ׀\rb*
